# Dashboard SPA routes — EXPLICIT rules only, never a /dash/* splat: rewrite
# rules are evaluated before assets, so a splat also swallows
# /dash/assets/*.js and breaks the app. Target must NOT end in index.html
# (Pages normalizes those targets and the rule never fires); app.html is a
# byte-identical copy of dash/index.html.
